   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Both stages together\n\nThe usual production setup for an upscale or refine pass that has to keep the original palette:\n\n1. **Apply Latent Color Guidance** holds the colour while the model works, so it never commits to the wrong palette.\n2. **A1111 Color Correction** cleans up whatever drift is left after the decode, which is cheap and exact.\n\n`Latent Color Match` is also wired here, running on the init latent before sampling starts — useful when the input itself is already off."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
